*----------------------------------------------------------------------
* RATES - CONVERSION RATES FROM USAGE TO RU (RESOURCE UNIT)
*   A RATE APPLIES FROM ITS EFFECTIVE DATE UNTIL THE NEXT ONE OF THE
*   SAME RESOURCE. NEVER CHANGE A RATE IN THE PAST: ADD A NEW LINE.
*   AMOUNT = USAGE * RATE, TRUNCATED TO A WHOLE RU PER RESOURCE.
*
*   COLS  1- 8 EFFECTIVE DATE YYYYMMDD
*   COLS 10-13 RESOURCE (CPU / MEM / NET / STOR)
*   COLS 15-24 RU PER UNIT OF USAGE, 99999.9999
*              CPU: CORE HOUR, MEM: GB HOUR, NET: GB, STOR: GB DAY
*----------------------------------------------------------------------
